      "Previous RS134-RS136 source-pinned receipts remain historical and immutable; RS137 must not replay --publish or rewrite any prior package identity."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After RS137 verifies the published package, qualify dw.quantities.expression and dw.quantities.standard with exact dependencies and isolated binary consumers; publish subsequent packages only after their own qualified immutable local-release gates.",
